page RecipeCopyToTheClipboard(path: "/recipes/copy-to-the-clipboard", title: "Copy to the clipboard — Recipes", description: "Copy text to the reader's clipboard from a button: an action that awaits the browser's clipboard, then shows a toast.") {
    RecipeShell("Copy to the clipboard", summary: "A **Copy** button saves the reader selecting a link by hand. To copy text, call the browser's clipboard from an action and say when it worked:", outputs: ["website", "app"], since: "", recipes: RECIPE_INDEX, sections: [Anchor(id: "how-it-works", label: "How it works")], related: [RelatedLink(kind: "Recipe", title: "Debounce a search", to: "/recipes/debounce-a-search"), RelatedLink(kind: "Recipe", title: "Count down", to: "/recipes/count-down"), RelatedLink(kind: "Recipe", title: "Make navigation responsive", to: "/recipes/responsive-navigation")], source: "md-docs/recipes/copy-to-the-clipboard.md", how: true, hasVariations: false, project: { "src/pages/CopyToTheClipboard.wf": #"page Share(path: "/share", title: "Share", description: "Copy the link.") {
    state copied = false
    state failed = false
    action copy(text: String) {
        copied = false
        failed = false
        try {
            await navigator.clipboard.writeText(text)
            copied = true
        } catch e {
            failed = true
        }
    }
    Heading("Share").h1
    Button("Copy the link") { on click { copy(location.href) } }
    if copied { Toast("Copied").success }
    if failed { Toast("Could not copy. Select the address and copy it by hand.").danger }
}
"#, "webfluent.app.json": #"{
  "name": "copy-to-the-clipboard"
}
"# }) {
        code {
            CodeBlock(#"page Share(path: "/share", title: "Share", description: "Copy the link.") {
    state copied = false
    state failed = false
    action copy(text: String) {
        copied = false
        failed = false
        try {
            await navigator.clipboard.writeText(text)
            copied = true
        } catch e {
            failed = true
        }
    }
    Heading("Share").h1
    Button("Copy the link") { on click { copy(location.href) } }
    if copied { Toast("Copied").success }
    if failed { Toast("Could not copy. Select the address and copy it by hand.").danger }
}"#, title: "wf")
        }
        Markdown("- `navigator.clipboard` and `location` are browser globals, used as written with no prefix.\n- `writeText` returns a promise, so the [action](/learn/07-state-and-reactivity#actions-and-locals) awaits it. `await` makes the action async, and `copied` is set only once the text is on the clipboard.\n- The browser may refuse: the page is not focused, it is not served over HTTPS, or the reader denied the permission. The promise then rejects, the `catch` sets `failed`, and the reader is told to copy by hand instead of seeing nothing.\n- The button's click handler calls `copy` with the page's own address.\n- A `Toast` shows once, when its branch is drawn. The action sets `copied` and `failed` back to `false` before it starts, so the branch is drawn again on every click and a second copy shows a second toast. Without that, `copied` would stay `true` and the second click would show nothing.")

    }
}
